     "resume": "The Cybersecurity Act (2025:1506) and Cybersecurity Ordinance (2025:1507) entered into force on 15 January 2026, replacing the 2018 NIS Act. Covered entities must register with authorities, implement appropriate security measures, train management and report significant incidents."
